{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["對耶路撒冷和猶大的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["看啊，主——萬軍之耶和華要從耶路撒冷和猶大拿去眾人倚靠的一切：糧食、水、"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"英雄、戰士、審判官、先知、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"占卜者、長老、","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五十夫長、顯貴、謀士、巧匠和巫師。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主必使少兒做他們的首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓孩童治理他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓將彼此欺凌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鄰居互相爭鬥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少年目無尊長，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卑賤者欺尊犯上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，人會拉住一位同族的弟兄說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你有外衣穿，你做我們的首領吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這廢墟之地就交給你了！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但那人必高聲說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我救不了你們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我家中無衣無食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓我做百姓的首領。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷崩潰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大敗落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們的言行冒犯耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蔑視榮耀的主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的表情顯出他們心術不正，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們跟所多瑪人一樣對自己的罪惡津津樂道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不隱瞞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必大禍臨頭，自招災難。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要告訴義人：他們必有福樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們必吃自己行為結出的果子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡人有禍了！他們必大禍臨頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因惡行而遭報應。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「我的子民啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"孩童欺壓你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"婦女管轄你們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的首領領你們入迷途，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶你們走歧路。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華準備就緒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要起來審判祂的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必審問祂子民中的長老和首領，對他們說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「就是你們毀壞了我的葡萄園，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"家裡堆著從窮人那裡掠奪的東西。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們為何壓榨我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"碾磨貧窮人的臉？」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主——萬軍之耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華又說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「錫安的女子狂傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"昂首走路，賣弄媚眼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"俏步徐行，腳鐲叮噹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要使她們頭上長瘡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"前額光禿。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["到那日，主必拿去她們美麗的腳鐲、髮飾、項鏈、"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耳環、手鐲、面紗、"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["頭飾、腳鏈、彩帶、香盒、護身符、"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["戒指、鼻環、"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["禮服、外袍、披肩、錢包、"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["鏡子、內衣、頭巾和圍巾。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"她們的香氣被臭味取代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"腰帶被繩子取代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"美髮被禿頭取代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"華服被麻衣取代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"美顏被烙印取代。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城中的男子將喪身刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇士將戰死沙場。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安的城門必悲傷、哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安必坐在地上，空空蕩蕩。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}